Add components to distilled water and bring volume to 900 ml.  Adjust pH to 7.0 and autoclave.  For preparation of solid medium, add 20.0 g/L Bacto agar (BD-Difco).  Separately autoclave the following solution:  <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 0.5 M Glycine-NaOH buffer (pH 10.0)                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;100.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
After autoclaving, add the solution to the medium.       <br>
